  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">NIV &#x2013; Restoration of 50 hectares of degraded agricultural and pastoral land at the Maliko site in the village of Boki</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This project will increase household fodder and agricultural production. The operation consists of restoring 50 hectares of degraded agricultural and pastoral land using erosion control techniques: forest half-moons and agricultural half-moons.En fran&#xe7;aisRestauration de 50 ha de terres agropastorales degrad&#xe9;es du site Maliko du village de BokiCe projet permettra d&apos;accroitre la production fourrage et agricole des m&#xe9;nages. L&apos;op&#xe9;ration consiste &#xe0; restaurer 50 ha de terres agricoles et pastorales d&#xe9;grad&#xe9;es &#xe0; travers les techniques de confection d&apos;ouvrages anti&#xe9;rosifs: d&#xe9;mi-lune foresti&#xe8;res, d&#xe9;mi-lune agricole.</narrative>
  </description>
